        {
          "kind": "list",
          "title": "Tree words",
          "items": [
            "**Root**: the first **node**.",
            "**Child**: a **node** below another node.",
            "**Leaf**: a **node** with no children.",
            "Subtree: a smaller **tree** starting at some **node**."
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "tone": "mistake",
          "title": "Null checks come early",
          "body": "Most **tree** **functions** start by checking for `None`, `null`, or `nullptr`. Without that check, reading `node.left` on a missing **node** can crash."
        },
